 "circuits": [
  {
   "id": "typical",
   "title": "Typical application",
   "page": 17,
   "description": "One brushed DC motor across OUT1 and OUT2. VM and VCC each have a 0.1 µF ceramic to ground right at the pin; GND and the thermal pad go to ground. nSLEEP and the two control inputs (IN1/IN2 on the DRV8837, PH/EN on the DRV8838) come in from the controller. The example design runs the motor from 9 V with a 3.3 V logic supply and 0.8 A rms in the winding.",
   "parts": [
